{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MZGXUH6a7ZCxnmRiLELo3G","type":"tool_result","content":"usage: stdo [-h] [--store STORE] [--version]\n            {install,list,resolve,verify,manifest,status,sync,adopt,cohort-update,bootstrap,fleet} ...\n\nInstall, resolve, verify, and adopt immutable STDO releases\n\npositional arguments:\n  {install,list,resolve,verify,manifest,status,sync,adopt,cohort-update,bootstrap,fleet}\n    install             Install one immutable STDO RC cut\n    list                List installed immutable STDO cuts\n    resolve             Resolve an installed stdo URI\n    verify              Verify an installed immutable STDO cut\n    manifest            Construct the deterministic installed-release manifest\n                        for a cut\n    status              Report one Product Definition basis\n    sync                Install and verify the exact basis selected by a\n                        Product Definition\n    adopt               Resolve a Product Definition selector and adopt its\n                        exact immutable cut\n    cohort-update       Plan or apply an explicitly selected complete consumer\n                        cohort\n    bootstrap           Install or refresh stable STDO markers in declared\n                        agent files\n    fleet               Operate on discovered Product Definitions\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --store STORE         Shared installation store (default:\n                        /Users/jim/Library/Application Support/STDO)\n  --version             show program's version number and exit\n=== rc=0 ===\nusage: stdo status [-h] --definition DEFINITION [--verify]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --definition DEFINITION\n  --verify\n=== rc=0 ===","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3e7f8b7a-72da-4ea8-aca4-b3dc5d35d1bb","uuid":"8a18db61-61b8-4942-a2b8-23fd6